      "offsetInSection": 5852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfin... !\nTu en es venu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à bout... !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00660069006E002E002E002E00200021000A0054007500200065006E002000650073002000760065006E007500100003110000FF01000065002000E000200062006F00750074002E002E002E0020002100100002011401E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toutes mes félicitations ! Tu as triomphé de mes\népreuves, et maîtrisé les trois techniques ultimes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces capacités sont extrêmement puissantes,\nmais gare au contrecoup qu’elles provoquent.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il te faudra faire montre de discernement et de\nstratégie pour les utiliser au moment opportun.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Travaille dur, et tu deviendras un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse\ncapable de les utiliser à bon escient.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
